<!--
  The three pages, and the set they form.

  **No <lastmod>.** Nothing in the release bumps this file, so the date
  would be whatever was true the day it was typed; Google ignores a lastmod
  it catches out once, and a wrong one is worse than none.

  **No robots.txt beside it either.** A crawler only reads robots.txt at the
  root of a host, and this site lives under /DtHub/ on a host that is not
  ours. One placed here would be read by nobody, and its Sitemap: line
  would point at a file nobody was told about. The address below has to be
  handed to Search Console and to Bing Webmaster Tools by hand, once.
-->
